description=Two-mode (daily/gaming) governor companion for BadazzKernel: gold-cluster cap, persistent (idempotent written) cd_thresholds 96/99/102/93, schedutil tuning, delegates to in-kernel k6a_gov. Single-source config, localhost WebUI. v1.4.9: mode=auto (pidof+cgroup top-app, Hysterese), Token-gated WebUI, Fork-Diet, setcfg atomar (mv), P4-Watchdog stays.
